[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:113. Small Change]
[00:01.621]Lesson 113 | 第113课
[00:04.545]Fairs, please. | 车费，请。
[00:07.055]Trafalgar Square, please. | 特拉法加广场，请。
[00:09.370]I'm sorry, sir. I can't change a pound note. | 对不起，先生。我不能找开一英镑纸币。
[00:13.545]Haven't you got any small change? | 你没有零钱吗？
[00:16.460]I've got no small change, I'm afraid. | 恐怕我没有零钱。
[00:19.400]I'll ask some of the passengers. | 我来问问其他的乘客。
[00:22.950]Have you any small change, sir? | 先生，你有零钱吗？
[00:26.475]I'm sorry, I've got none. | 对不起，我没有。
[00:28.895]I haven't got any either. | 我也没有。
[00:31.655]Can you change this pound note, madam? | 小姐，你能找开这张英镑纸币吗？
[00:35.260]I'm afraid I can't. | 恐怕我不能。
[00:37.320]Neither can I. | 我也不能。
[00:39.645]I'm very sorry, sir. | 我很抱歉，先生。
[00:42.280]You must get off the bus. | 你必须下车。
[00:44.610]None of our passengers can change this note. | 我们的乘客都没有零钱。
[00:48.055]They're all millionaires. | 他们都是百万富翁。
[00:50.685]Except us, conductor. | 除了我们，售票员。
[00:53.705]I've got some small change. | 我有零钱。
[00:56.530]So have I. | 我也有。